/given-names></name><name><surname>Partensky</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mixed hepato/cholangiocarcinoma with paraneoplastic hypercalcemia</article-title><source>Hepatobiliary Pancreat Surg</source><year>2008</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>224</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00534-007-1235-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chattopadhyay</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of calcium-sensing receptor on the secretion of parathyroid hormone-related peptide and its impact on humoral hypercalcemia of malignancy</article-title><source>Am J Physiol Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2006</year><volume>290</volume><fpage>E761</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16603723</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1152/ajpendo.00350.2005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Suva</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Winslow</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Wettenhall</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hammonds</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Moseley</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Diefenbach-Jagger</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodda</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Kemp</surname><given-names>BE</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodriguez</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>EY</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>A parathyroid hormone-related protein implicated in malignant hypercalcemia: cloning and expression</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1987</year><volume>237</volume><fpage>893</fpage><lpage